## Contract findings

All strategy closeout gates 2.A through 2.G hold at audited_head. The
implementation is policy-neutral, uses exact BigInt decimal conversion,
minimizes data through a fixed output grammar, binds receipts to evidence
authorization, authorizes before any repository call, audits denial and
scope failures without repository calls, rolls back staged state on failure,
and resolves concurrent commands as accepted+replay or accepted+conflict.
The pilot contract returns liveSourceAdaptersUsed: [] and rejects unknown
packet versions. No real pilot is claimed. Phase 1 production is unchanged.

